  "readme": "# 🇺🇸 USA Travel Planner\n\n> **An inspiration board for exploring America.** All 63 national parks on a clickable map, every state fair, every federal holiday, the iconic regional fast-food chain in each state — plus an agent that scans X and news every week for cool stuff happening right now.\n\n## 🗺️ Where to next\n\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:14px;margin:18px 0 28px;\">\n\n<div style=\"background:#FFF9E9;border:1px solid #E8DDC5;border-left:4px solid #3F6F44;border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1;flex-shrink:0;\">🗺️</span>\n  <div>\n    <div style=\"font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.005em;margin-bottom:4px;\">[[parks-map/index|Open the parks map]]</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#7A6B5D;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;\">click markers to log visits</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#FFF9E9;border:1px solid #E8DDC5;border-left:4px solid #2E4156;border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1;flex-shrink:0;\">📡</span>\n  <div>\n    <div style=\"font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.005em;margin-bottom:4px;\">[[inspiration/index|Inspiration Feed]]</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#7A6B5D;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;\">Event Hunter's weekly finds</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#FFF9E9;border:1px solid #E8DDC5;border-left:4px solid #6B8E5A;border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1;flex-shrink:0;\">🏞️</span>\n  <div>\n    <div style=\"font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.005em;margin-bottom:4px;\">[[national-parks/index|Parks overview]]</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#7A6B5D;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;\">all 63 + monthly spotlight</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#FFF9E9;border:1px solid #E8DDC5;border-left:4px solid #B8892E;border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1;flex-shrink:0;\">🎡</span>\n  <div>\n    <div style=\"font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.005em;margin-bottom:4px;\">[[events/index|Events by category]]</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#7A6B5D;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;\">music, food, sports, quirky</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#FFF9E9;border:1px solid #E8DDC5;border-left:4px solid #8B2E3E;border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1;flex-shrink:0;\">🎆</span>\n  <div>\n    <div style=\"font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.005em;margin-bottom:4px;\">[[holidays/index|Holidays — where to be]]</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#7A6B5D;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;\">where to be for each one</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#FFF9E9;border:1px solid #E8DDC5;border-left:4px solid #8B5E3C;border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1;flex-shrink:0;\">🍔</span>\n  <div>\n    <div style=\"font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.005em;margin-bottom:4px;\">[[fast-food/index|Regional fast food]]</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#7A6B5D;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;\">iconic chain in each state</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#FFF9E9;border:1px solid #E8DDC5;border-left:4px solid #5E3C8B;border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1;flex-shrink:0;\">📊</span>\n  <div>\n    <div style=\"font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.005em;margin-bottom:4px;\">[[bucket-list/index|Bucket List dashboard]]</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#7A6B5D;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;\">% across parks, fairs, holidays</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n## Your team\n\nTwo agents. Ask either anything in the AI panel.\n\n- 🧭 **Travel Curator** — plans trips, stitches multi-stop itineraries, balances your bucket list against your calendar. Also covers national parks (trails, seasons, permits), regional food (iconic chains by state, BBQ regions), and holidays (where to be for each one).\n- 📡 **Event Hunter** — scans X / news / Reddit / Eventbrite weekly, appends finds to the [[inspiration/index|Inspiration Feed]]\n\n## Pick your starting point\n\n**Got a weekend?** Open [[parks-map/index|the parks map]] and find the closest one you haven't been to.\n**Got two weeks?** Ask the Travel Curator: *\"Plan a 14-day road trip from [your city] hitting 3 parks I haven't visited.\"*\n**Just browsing?** Read the [[inspiration/index|Inspiration Feed]] — that's where the Event Hunter posts what's actually cool right now.\n**Hungry?** [[fast-food/index|Fast Food]] — pick a state, find your meal.",
